{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DkWytnvnvdQUoNmZk36CCi","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Permutation null 暴露 temporal cohort structure 对 MH-DIF 的系统性 inflation：1000×\n2\t  permutation 产生 C%=8–18% 的 null baseline，将 31.3% headline 拉低至 15–23% genuine item-level\n3\t  instability。Ability confound 比 plan_027 的 2.4pp 估计严重——NN matching 未覆盖的 latent dimensions（57-subject\n4\t  multidimensionality） 留下 6–12pp residual。Reviewer 共识：(1) no methodological contribution（MH\n5\t  1988 直接套用）， (2) 31% inflated 且 permutation-calibrated number 不够 dramatic，(3) diagnostic\n6\t  lens 是 post-hoc reframing 缺乏 prospective validation。GSM8K negative correlation 被解读为\n7\t  DIF=ability proxy。 HellaSwag/GSM8K 的低 C% 与 MMLU 的高 C% 差异被质疑为 method artifact（item\n8\t  count / domain structure 驱动）。 Reframe 方向：permutation calibration methodology 本身升格为\n9\t  contribution，semi-synthetic framework 作为 primary，empirical atlas 作为 resource，headline\n10\t  从 ''31% instability'' 改为 ''permutation-calibrated 15–23% genuine instability + calibration\n11\t  methodology for future DIF studies''。仍冲 EMNLP long paper 但需 camera-ready 前补 propensity-score\n12\t  matching 或 MIMIC model。\n13\t\n14\t  '\n15\timagined_experiments:\n16\t- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n17\t  plan_id: plan_001\n18\t  description: 'METABENCH MMLU 5,219×12,508 response matrix 上的 MH-DIF，temporal/ability/within-family\n19\t    cohort 对比 + Li et al. proxy validation + domain-specificity。\n20\t\n21\t    '\n22\t  expected_results:\n23\t    temporal_ets_c_pct: 31.3\n24\t    temporal_fpr_li_clean: 0.321\n25\t    temporal_enrichment: 0.96\n26\t    ability_ets_c_pct: 2.9\n27\t    ability_enrichment: 1.19\n28\t    within_family_llama2v3_c_pct: 61.3\n29\t    within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n30\t    domain_spearman_rho: 0.36\n31\t    domain_spearman_p: 0.006\n32\t    sanity_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n33\t    temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n34\t    n_subjects_with_nonzero_c: 57\n35\t    subject_c_range: 20.7–48.4%\n36\t  result_rationale: 'Raw numbers 与 registry 一致（plan_001 已完成），但在 worst 档下这些数字被后续实验重新解读：\n37\t    31.3% 中有 8–18pp 来自 temporal structure（plan_029 permutation null），domain ρ=0.36（略高于\n38\t    registry 的 0.307）意味着 domain-level ability improvement 的解释力比预期更强。 Llama-2v3 C%=61.3%\n39\t    被 reviewer 用作 ''DIF captures ability gap'' 的直接证据——d=-0.99 的 cohort 产生 61.3% C%，d=-0.17\n40\t    产生 31.3%，线性外推 d=0 时 C%≈25%，与 permutation null 上界吻合。enrichment≈1.0 仍然成立但对 reviewer\n41\t    来说是 ''DIF 与 contamination 无关'' 的证据 而非 ''web labels 不适用'' 的证据——framing battle 在\n42\t    worst 档下输给 reviewer。\n43\t\n44\t    '\n45\t  tables:\n46\t  - name: 'Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary by Cohort Definition'\n47\t    rows:\n48\t    - cohort: temporal_2023v2024\n49\t      n_ref: 1080\n50\t      n_foc: 807\n51\t      c_pct: 31.3\n52\t      enrichment: 0.96\n53\t      permutation_null_c_pct: 12.4 (worst-tier midpoint)\n54\t      genuine_c_pct: ~18.9\n55\t    - cohort: ability_quintile\n56\t      n_ref: 1044\n57\t      n_foc: 1044\n58\t      c_pct: 2.9\n59\t      enrichment: 1.19\n60\t      permutation_null_c_pct: 0.21\n61\t      genuine_c_pct: ~2.7\n62\t    - cohort: within_family_llama2v3\n63\t      n_ref: 161\n64\t      n_foc: 308\n65\t      c_pct: 61.3\n66\t      enrichment: null\n67\t      permutation_null_c_pct: '38.2'\n68\t      genuine_c_pct: ~23.1\n69\t  - name: 'Table 2: Domain-Specificity Top/Bottom 5 Subjects'\n70\t    note: C% range 20.7–48.4%, ρ=0.36 with domain accuracy Δ\n71\t  figures_description:\n72\t  - 'Fig 1: C% histogram across 57 MMLU subjects, colored by domain accuracy Δ quartile\n73\t    — worst 档下 top-quartile accuracy-Δ subjects 明显偏高 C%，ρ=0.36 可视化为斜向聚集'\n74\t  analysis: 'plan_001 的 raw output 在 worst 档下不变，但 interpretive frame 被 plan_029 的\n75\t    permutation null 彻底重写。31.3% 不再是 headline——permutation-calibrated 的 ~19% 才是。domain\n76\t    ρ=0.36 虽然 item-level R²仍低（0.0007），但 reviewer 会 argue ecological correlation 足以\n77\t    cast doubt。within-family Llama-2v3 的 61.3% 成为 ability confound 的 poster child。\n78\t\n79\t    '\n80\t- name: rl_robustness_validation\n81\t  plan_id: plan_002\n82\t  description: '验证 DIF 对 reasoning-RL 模型的鲁棒性：SFT baseline + alignment-RL (N=477) +\n83\t    10-15 reasoning-RL models mixed into focal cohort。\n84\t\n85\t    '\n86\t  expected_results:\n87\t    sft_baseline_c_pct: 30.8\n88\t    alignment_rl_cohort_c_pct: 31.1\n89\t    reasoning_rl_mixed_c_pct: 30.5\n90\t    dif_retention_jaccard_sft_vs_rl_mixed: 0.82\n91\t    constat_auroc_on_rl_models: 0.58\n92\t    mink_auroc_on_rl_models: 0.54\n93\t    delong_p_dif_vs_constat: 0.34\n94\t    tost_equivalence_p: 0.18\n95\t    bootstrap_ci_dif_retention:\n96\t    - 0.74\n97\t    - 0.89\n98\t    n_reasoning_rl_models: 13\n99\t    n_total_focal_with_rl: 820\n100\t  result_rationale: 'N=13 reasoning-RL 模型混入 N=807 focal cohort 后 total N=820，DIF 作为\n101\t    group-level 方法对 13 个模型的加入不敏感（C% 从 31.3 微降至 30.5）。但这恰恰是问题：reviewer 指出 13/820=1.6%\n102\t    的混入比例根本无法测试 robustness——即使 RL 模型完全破坏 DIF 信号， 1.6% 的权重也会被 group statistic 淹没。TOST\n103\t    equivalence test p=0.18 不显著， 无法声称等价。DeLong test p=0.34 也不显著，但这是因为 power 不足而非真正等价。\n104\t    ConStat/MinK 在 RL 模型上的 AUROC 降至 0.54-0.58（接近随机），但 N=13 的 CI 极宽， 任何比较都 underpowered。整个实验在\n105\t    worst 档下被 reviewer 一致判定为 underpowered 且设计上无法回答其声称要回答的问题。移入 appendix 作为 preliminary\n106\t    evidence。\n107\t\n108\t    '\n109\t  tables:\n110\t  - name: 'Table: DIF Retention Under Cohort Composition Variation'\n111\t    rows:\n112\t    - condition: SFT-only focal\n113\t      n_focal: 412\n114\t      c_pct: 30.8\n115\t      jaccard_vs_baseline: 0.87\n116\t    - condition: Alignment-RL focal\n117\t      n_focal: 477\n118\t      c_pct: 31.1\n119\t      jaccard_vs_baseline: 0.89\n120\t    - condition: Reasoning-RL mixed\n121\t      n_focal: 820\n122\t      c_pct: 30.5\n123\t      jaccard_vs_baseline: 0.82\n124\t  figures_description:\n125\t  - 'Fig: AUROC comparison (DIF group-level vs ConStat/MinK per-model) on 13 RL models\n126\t    — wide bootstrap CIs overlapping random baseline'\n127\t  analysis: 'Worst 档下这个实验是 paper 的 liability 而非 asset。N=13 的 reasoning-RL sample 使任何统计声明都不可信。Reviewer\n128\t    会指出：(a) 1.6% 混入比例是 trivial perturbation， (b) 缺乏 GRPO/PPO 模型的 MMLU response data\n129\t    是 data limitation 而非 DIF limitation， (c) ''DIF is group-level so it doesn''t need\n130\t    N≥80 RL'' 的 argument 回避了真正的问题。 建议：从 main body 移除，appendix 中报告为 ''preliminary with\n131\t    acknowledged power limitation''。\n132\t\n133\t    '\n134\t- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n135\t  plan_id: plan_003a\n136\t  description: 'ConStat-style perturbation测试：200+ MMLU items 的 LLM paraphrase + FDR-controlled\n137\t    detection。\n138\t\n139\t    '\n140\t  expected_results:\n141\t    n_items_paraphrased: 240\n142\t    constat_detection_rate_non_rl: 0.23\n143\t    constat_detection_rate_rl: 0.07\n144\t    constat_fdr_controlled_fpr: 0.08\n145\t    constat_dif_overlap_jaccard: 0.11\n146\t    paraphrase_semantic_similarity: 0.91\n147\t    gpu_hours_used: 72\n148\t    n_models_tested: 50\n149\t  result_rationale: 'ConStat 在 non-RL 模型上检测率 23%（中等），但在 RL 模型上暴跌至 7%——符合理论预期 但 N=240\n150\t    items × 50 models 的规模使 CI 宽。与 DIF flags 的 Jaccard=0.11 极低， 意味着两种方法检测不同维度的 instability。在\n151\t    worst 档下，reviewer 将此解读为 ''两种方法都不可靠'' 而非 ''互补覆盖''。paraphrase quality（similarity=0.91）被质疑\n152\t    为不够 semantically equivalent——任何 detection 可能是 paraphrase artifact。 80 GPU hours\n153\t    的投入产出比在 worst 档下被认为不值得放入 main body。\n154\t\n155\t    '\n156\t  tables: []\n157\t  figures_description:\n158\t  - 'Fig: ConStat detection rate vs DIF C-flag rate per subject, showing near-zero\n159\t    correlation'\n160\t  analysis: 'ConStat 独立结果在 worst 档下价值有限：detection rate 低且与 DIF 正交。 如果 reviewer 已经质疑\n161\t    DIF 的 31% 是 inflated，ConStat 的 23% 也面临同样的 calibration 问题（没有 permutation null）。实验本身\n162\t    clean 但不 strengthen paper。 建议：appendix baseline comparison，不作为 contribution。\n163\t\n164\t    '\n165\t- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n166\t  plan_id: plan_003b\n167\t  description: 'DVD generation variance：10-15 open-weight 模型 × 50 responses/item ×\n168\t    temperature sampling。\n169\t\n170\t    '\n171\t  expected_results:\n172\t    n_models: 12\n173\t    n_items: 500\n174\t    responses_per_item: 50\n175\t    dvd_bimodal_detection_rate: 0.14\n176\t    dvd_verbatim_detection_power: 0.09\n177\t    dvd_variant_detection_power: 0.31\n178\t    dvd_fpr: 0.12\n179\t    gpu_hours_used: 65\n180\t    dvd_dif_overlap_jaccard: 0.06\n181\t  result_rationale: 'DVD 设计用于 variant contamination（模型见过 paraphrase 而非原题），对 verbatim\n182\t    contamination 的检测力极低（0.09）。Bimodal distribution 在 temperature=0.7-1.0 下确实出现但 only\n183\t    14% 的 items——大部分 contaminated items 不产生 bimodal variance 因为 LLM 在 high temperature\n184\t    下的 stochasticity 掩盖了 memorization signal。 与 DIF 的 Jaccard=0.06 接近零：两种方法在 item-level\n185\t    上几乎完全不重叠。 在 worst 档下，70 GPU hours 产出一个 near-null result，reviewer 认为 DVD evaluation\n186\t    与 paper 的 temporal DIF 主线无关。\n187\t\n188\t    '\n189\t  tables: []\n190\t  figures_description:\n191\t  - 'Fig: Bimodal score distribution example for 3 items — showing weak signal'\n192\t  analysis: 'DVD 在 worst 档下是 sunk cost。Detection power 不足以作为 standalone baseline，\n193\t    与 DIF 的互补性接近零。Reviewer 质疑为什么在 temporal DIF paper 中评估 generation variance method。建议：完全\n194\t    drop，不进 appendix。\n195\t\n196\t    '\n197\t- name: ensemble_fusion\n198\t  plan_id: plan_003c\n199\t  description: 'DIF + ConStat + DVD 三信号融合：majority voting + weighted fusion + cross-validation。\n200\t\n201\t    '\n202\t  expected_results:\n203\t    ensemble_not_executed: true\n204\t    reason: upstream signal quality insufficient for meaningful fusion\n205\t    constat_weak: true\n206\t    dvd_near_null: true\n207\t    projected_2of3_tpr: 0.15\n208\t    projected_2of3_fpr: 0.06\n209\t    decision: killed — degrade to appendix note\n210\t  result_rationale: 'ConStat detection rate=23% 和 DVD detection rate=14% 均低于 DIF 的\n211\t    31.3%， 且三者 pairwise Jaccard 均<0.12。2-of-3 majority voting 的 TPR 暴跌至 ~15% 因为 agreement\n212\t    极低——三种方法检测的是不同 item populations。Weighted fusion 可能略好但 cross-validation 在 N=240\n213\t    items 上 overfit 风险高。在 worst 档下 ensemble 从未执行（per paper_framing: ''plan_003a/b/c\n214\t    never executed''）， 这一决策被 worst 档的 upstream results 证明正确。\n215\t\n216\t    '\n217\t  tables: []\n218\t  figures_description: []\n219\t  analysis: 'Ensemble 在 worst 档下正确地被 kill。upstream 信号质量不足、方法间 overlap 极低、 fusion 没有理论基础（不是\n220\t    ''same signal different noise'' 而是 ''different signals''）。 Paper framing 中已标记为\n221\t    ''Future work''。\n222\t\n223\t    '\n224\t- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n225\t  plan_id: plan_004\n226\t  description: 'GSM8K temporal DIF + GSM1K ground truth correlation + semi-synthetic\n227\t    validation。\n228\t\n229\t    '\n230\t  expected_results:\n231\t    step1_gsm8k_temporal_c_pct: 18.9\n232\t    step1_external_c_pct: 47.4\n233\t    step1_sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n234\t    step2_standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n235\t    step2_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n236\t    step2_standard_delta_tpr_p05: 0.32\n237\t    step3_pearson_r: -0.478\n238\t    step3_pearson_p: 0.005\n239\t    step3_spearman_rho: -0.403\n240\t    step3_n_models: 33\n241\t    step3_ci_r:\n242\t    - -0.71\n243\t    - -0.16\n244\t    step3_ci_rho:\n245\t    - -0.66\n246\t    - -0.03\n247\t    permutation_null_gsm8k_c_pct: 9.2\n248\t    genuine_c_pct_after_calibration: 9.7\n249\t  result_rationale: 'GSM8K C%=18.9% 在 permutation calibration 后降至 ~9.7%（null=9.2%），远低于\n250\t    MMLU calibrated ~19%。Reviewer 质疑：如果 permutation null 已经解释了一半的 GSM8K C%， genuine\n251\t    instability 可能微不足道。Step 3 的 negative correlation (r=-0.478) 是 worst 档的核心问题——reviewer\n252\t    解读为 ''DIF flags items where 2024 models improved most, and GSM1K gap shrinks for\n253\t    these models because improvement is genuine (not contamination)''。即 DIF 不是在检测\n254\t    instability 而是在检测 ability improvement。 ΔTPR at p=0.5 降至 0.32（worst 档范围内），semi-synthetic\n255\t    仍然 work 但 power reduction 明显。N=33 使所有 correlation 的 CI 宽到包含 near-zero effect。\n256\t\n257\t    '\n258\t  tables:\n259\t  - name: 'Table: GSM8K DIF Summary with Permutation Calibration'\n260\t    rows:\n261\t    - metric: raw_c_pct\n262\t      value: 18.9\n263\t    - metric: permutation_null_c_pct\n264\t      value: 9.2\n265\t    - metric: calibrated_genuine_c_pct\n266\t      value: 9.7\n267\t    - metric: gsm1k_correlation_r\n268\t      value: -0.478\n269\t    - metric: gsm1k_correlation_ci\n270\t      value: '[-0.71, -0.16]'\n271\t  figures_description:\n272\t  - 'Fig: Scatter plot of DIF-C item proportion vs GSM1K gap (N=33 models) — negative\n273\t    trend with wide CI band, annotated Deepseek-math-7b-rl as potential outlier'\n274\t  analysis: 'GSM8K 在 worst 档下是 double-edged：semi-synthetic ΔTPR=0.818（p=1.0）证明 framework\n275\t    portability，但 GSM1K negative correlation 被 reviewer 武器化为 ''DIF = ability proxy''\n276\t    的证据。Permutation calibration 将 genuine C% 压至 ~10%， further weakening the instability\n277\t    narrative。Paper 必须将 GSM1K correlation 从 ''contamination validation'' 完全 pivot\n278\t    到 ''exploratory/anomalous finding requiring further investigation''。N=33 的 limitation\n279\t    必须 prominent display。\n280\t\n281\t    '\n282\t- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n283\t  plan_id: plan_005\n284\t  description: 'MMLU 57-subject bifactor IRT model + anchor item selection + fixed-parameter\n285\t    calibration。\n286\t\n287\t    '\n288\t  expected_results:\n289\t    bifactor_convergence: false\n290\t    attempted_subjects: 57\n291\t    converged_subjects: 23\n292\t    rmsea_converged: 0.089\n293\t    cfi_converged: 0.74\n294\t    tli_converged: 0.71\n295\t    anchor_items_selected: 0\n296\t    equating_completed: false\n297\t    killed: true\n298\t    kill_reason: bifactor non-convergence on 34/57 subjects; converged subjects show\n299\t      poor fit\n300\t  result_rationale: '57-subject MMLU 的 bifactor model 在 worst 档下无法收敛——items per subject\n301\t    从 18（formal_logic）到 1534（miscellaneous），subject-specific factors 的 sample size\n302\t    极不均衡。即使 converged subjects（23/57）的 fit 也差（RMSEA=0.089, CFI=0.74）， 因为 MMLU items\n303\t    不满足 unidimensional within-subject assumption（moral_scenarios Q3=34.2% above 0.20）。没有\n304\t    reliable bifactor model 就没有 anchor items， equating pipeline 无法启动。这与 registry 中\n305\t    plan_015 被 killed 一致。 在 worst 档下，这不仅是 technical failure 而是 structural impossibility——\n306\t    MMLU 的 multidimensionality 从根本上不适合 bifactor parameterization。\n307\t\n308\t    '\n309\t  tables: []\n310\t  figures_description: []\n311\t  analysis: 'Bifactor failure 在 worst 档下被 reviewer 用作两面攻击：(1) ''if bifactor fails,\n312\t    your MH-DIF conditioning on total score is even more misspecified''，(2) ''you\n313\t    acknowledge multidimensionality but use a unidimensional method''。Defense： MH\n314\t    conditions on observed total score（nonparametric），不依赖 IRT model fit。 但 reviewer\n315\t    不一定接受这个区分。建议：limitations 中 prominently acknowledge， frame as motivation for future\n316\t    multidimensional DIF work。\n317\t\n318\t    '\n319\t- name: item_generation_calibration\n320\t  plan_id: plan_006\n321\t  description: 'LLM-generated replacement items for DIF-flagged questions + student\n322\t    simulation calibration。\n323\t\n324\t    '\n325\t  expected_results:\n326\t    n_items_generated: 300\n327\t    difficulty_correlation_prompt: 0.18\n328\t    difficulty_correlation_simulation: 0.62\n329\t    difficulty_correlation_empirical: 0.48\n330\t    subject_match_rate: 0.83\n331\t    cognitive_level_match_rate: 0.61\n332\t    holdout_model_panel_rho: 0.72\n333\t    gpu_hours_used: 180\n334\t    item_quality_pass_rate: 0.41\n335\t  result_rationale: 'Item generation 在 worst 档下的核心问题是 calibration accuracy：prompt-based\n336\t    difficulty targeting 仍然差（ρ=0.18），student simulation 改善至 0.62 但不及 arXiv 报告的 0.75-0.82\n337\t    因为 MMLU 的 57-subject diversity 使 simulation 泛化差。 Empirical calibration（在 holdout\n338\t    models 上测试）降至 0.48，因为 LLM-generated items 的 discrimination 系统性偏低（生成的 items 倾向于\n339\t    either too easy or 随机 difficulty）。41% 的 quality pass rate 意味着 300 items 中只有 ~123\n340\t    可用。 Cognitive level matching 只有 61% 因为 MMLU 本身没有 explicit cognitive level labels。在\n341\t    worst 档下，reviewer 认为 item generation 是 tangential to paper''s contribution 且 execution\n342\t    quality 不足以支撑任何 claim。\n343\t\n344\t    '\n345\t  tables: []\n346\t  figures_description:\n347\t  - 'Fig: Difficulty calibration scatter — generated vs empirical, showing systematic\n348\t    underestimation of hard items'\n349\t  analysis: 'Item generation 在 worst 档下应完全 drop from paper。ρ=0.48 的 empirical calibration\n350\t    + 41% pass rate 不构成 contribution。且 paper 已 pivot away from ''regeneration'' toward\n351\t    ''diagnostic lens''，generation 不 serve the narrative。 180 GPU hours sunk cost。\n352\t\n353\t    '\n354\t- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n355\t  plan_id: plan_007\n356\t  description: 'Sinharay et al. (2006) cumulative Bayesian DIF priors across 4 simulated\n357\t    administrations。\n358\t\n359\t    '\n360\t  expected_results:\n361\t    single_admin_power_d10: 0.38\n362\t    cumulative_2_admin_power_d10: 0.52\n363\t    cumulative_3_admin_power_d10: 0.61\n364\t    cumulative_4_admin_power_d10: 0.67\n365\t    target_power_0_70_reached: false\n366\t    single_admin_power_d14: 0.59\n367\t    cumulative_3_admin_power_d14: 0.74\n368\t    fpr_cumulative: 0.055\n369\t    prior_specification_sensitivity: moderate — informative vs diffuse prior changes\n370\t      power by ±0.08\n371\t  result_rationale: 'Cumulative power 在 worst 档下不达标（0.67 < 0.70 at δ=1.0 after 4 admins），\n372\t    因为 simulation 使用 realistic parameters（not optimistic）：inter-administration correlation\n373\t    of DIF effects < 1.0（items 的 DIF 在不同时间点不完全一致）， prior-posterior updating efficiency\n374\t    受 small N per administration 限制。 Prior specification sensitivity ±0.08 意味着结果对分析选择敏感。\n375\t    Reviewer 认为：(a) simulation-only 没有 empirical grounding，(b) 4 administrations 是假设性的（METABENCH\n376\t    只有 1 snapshot），(c) power improvement 从 0.38 到 0.67 modest且 costly（需要 4× data）。\n377\t\n378\t    '\n379\t  tables:\n380\t  - name: 'Table: Cumulative Power by Administration Count'\n381\t    rows:\n382\t    - admins: 1\n383\t      power_d10: 0.38\n384\t      power_d14: 0.59\n385\t    - admins: 2\n386\t      power_d10: 0.52\n387\t      power_d14: 0.68\n388\t    - admins: 3\n389\t      power_d10: 0.61\n390\t      power_d14: 0.74\n391\t    - admins: 4\n392\t      power_d10: 0.67\n393\t      power_d14: 0.78\n394\t  figures_description:\n395\t  - 'Fig: Power accumulation curves at δ=1.0 and δ=1.4, with 70% threshold line —\n396\t    δ=1.0 never crosses'\n397\t  analysis: 'Simulation-only experiment 在 worst 档下是 appendix material。不达 0.70 target\n398\t    at δ=1.0 是 honest result 但 weakens the ''DIF is practical'' narrative。 Reviewer：''if\n399\t    you need 4 benchmark snapshots to detect medium effects, the method is impractical\n400\t    for real-time monitoring.'' 建议：brief mention in future work， 不进 main body。\n401\t\n402\t    '\n403\t- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n404\t  plan_id: plan_008\n405\t  description: 'Progressive item replacement (5%-50%) 下 validity degradation 的理论 +\n406\t    实证分析。\n407\t\n408\t    '\n409\t  expected_results:\n410\t    rho_5pct_replacement: 0.998\n411\t    rho_10pct_replacement: 0.995\n412\t    rho_20pct_replacement: 0.987\n413\t    rho_50pct_replacement: 0.962\n414\t    reliability_alpha_full: 0.94\n415\t    reliability_alpha_50pct_replaced: 0.88\n416\t    construct_coverage_50pct: 0.79\n417\t    degradation_rate: non-linear — accelerates after 30%\n418\t    theoretical_bound_violation_at: 42% replacement\n419\t  result_rationale: 'Graceful degradation 在 worst 档下呈现 non-linear cliff：前 20% replacement\n420\t    几乎无影响（ρ=0.987），但 30%+ 后加速恶化，50% 时 reliability 降至 0.88（acceptable 但 approaching\n421\t    concern），construct coverage 降至 0.79。问题是：31% 的 DIF items 恰好落在 cliff 的起始区域——如果要\n422\t    replace 所有 flagged items，degradation 开始 加速。Reviewer 会 point out：''your own analysis\n423\t    shows that replacing 31% of items causes non-trivial degradation, undermining\n424\t    the regeneration rationale.'' 但 paper 已 pivot away from regeneration，所以这个 concern\n425\t    被 defused。 不过 worst 档下 reviewer 仍然 raise it as internal inconsistency。\n426\t\n427\t    '\n428\t  tables:\n429\t  - name: 'Table: Validity Metrics Under Progressive Replacement'\n430\t    rows:\n431\t    - pct_replaced: 5\n432\t      rho: 0.998\n433\t      alpha: 0.935\n434\t      coverage: 0.97\n435\t    - pct_replaced: 10\n436\t      rho: 0.995\n437\t      alpha: 0.928\n438\t      coverage: 0.95\n439\t    - pct_replaced: 20\n440\t      rho: 0.987\n441\t      alpha: 0.912\n442\t      coverage: 0.91\n443\t    - pct_replaced: 50\n444\t      rho: 0.962\n445\t      alpha: 0.88\n446\t      coverage: 0.79\n447\t  figures_description:\n448\t  - 'Fig: Degradation curves for ρ, α, coverage — showing non-linear cliff around\n449\t    30%'\n450\t  analysis: 'Graceful degradation 在 worst 档下是 supplementary material。Non-linear cliff\n451\t    at ~30% 是 interesting finding 但与 reframed narrative（diagnostic lens, not replacement\n452\t    protocol）的关系 tangential。建议：appendix 中报告，main body 中 一句话引用 ''replacement beyond\n453\t    30% shows accelerating degradation''。\n454\t\n455\t    '\n456\t- name: item_focused_trees\n457\t  plan_id: plan_009\n458\t  description: 'Tutz & Berger (2016) IFT：release date 作为 continuous covariate 的 DIF\n459\t    检测。\n460\t\n461\t    '\n462\t  expected_results:\n463\t    ift_c_pct_continuous: 27.4\n464\t    ift_mh_concordance: 0.78\n465\t    ift_detects_gradual_drift: true\n466\t    n_items_gradual_not_abrupt: 1840\n467\t    pct_gradual: 47.0\n468\t    ift_vs_mh_power_ratio: 0.92\n469\t    computation_time_hours: 8.2\n470\t  result_rationale: 'IFT 在 worst 档下揭示一个 uncomfortable truth：47% 的 DIF items 展示的是 gradual\n471\t    temporal drift 而非 abrupt cohort shift。这意味着 MH 的 binary temporal split (2023 vs\n472\t    2024) 人为地将 continuous process discretize——reviewer 质疑 为什么不直接用 IFT。IFT concordance\n473\t    with MH = 0.78（不够高），IFT C%=27.4% vs MH 31.3%——差异来自 IFT 对 gradual drift 的不同 classification。\n474\t    IFT 的 power ratio=0.92（vs MH）表明 continuous approach 没有 power advantage， 反而 computational\n475\t    cost 高 8×。但 reviewer 的 concern 不是 power 而是 validity： ''if drift is gradual, your\n476\t    cohort-based framework is misspecified.''\n477\t\n478\t    '\n479\t  tables:\n480\t  - name: 'Table: IFT vs MH Detection Comparison'\n481\t    rows:\n482\t    - method: MH categorical\n483\t      c_pct: 31.3\n484\t      computation_hours: 1.0\n485\t      gradual_detection: 'no'\n486\t    - method: IFT continuous\n487\t      c_pct: 27.4\n488\t      computation_hours: 8.2\n489\t      gradual_detection: yes (47% gradual)\n490\t  figures_description:\n491\t  - 'Fig: Example items showing gradual vs abrupt DIF trajectories — IFT captures\n492\t    both, MH only captures abrupt'\n493\t  analysis: 'IFT 在 worst 档下是 challenging but informative robustness check。47% gradual\n494\t    drift 的 finding 如果放在 main body 会 undermine categorical DIF framework。 但如果放在 appendix\n495\t    作为 ''MH is conservative approximation of continuous drift'' 的 evidence，可以 strengthen\n496\t    而非 weaken the paper。关键 framing：''MH detects the 53% of items with abrupt changes\n497\t    + partially detects the 47% with gradual drift — our 31% is a lower bound on items\n498\t    with ANY temporal instability.'' 这需要 careful writing 但在 worst 档下是 feasible defense。\n499\t\n500\t    '\n501\t- name: architecture_stratified_dif\n502\t  plan_id: plan_010\n503\t  description: 'Decoder-only subpopulation DIF + IRT fit diagnostics。\n504\t\n505\t    '\n506\t  expected_results:\n507\t    n_decoder_only: 5226\n508\t    n_non_decoder: 1\n509\t    pct_decoder_only: 99.98\n510\t    decoder_only_c_pct: 31.3\n511\t    full_population_c_pct: 31.3\n512\t    jaccard_decoder_vs_full: 1.0\n513\t    rmsea_decoder_only: 0.048\n514\t    cfi_decoder_only: 0.71\n515\t    tli_decoder_only: 0.68\n516\t    srmr_decoder_only: 0.052\n517\t    irt_fit_improved: false\n518\t  result_rationale: 'METABENCH MMLU 是 99.98% decoder-only（5226/5227），移除 1 个 non-decoder\n519\t    模型 改变 nothing（Jaccard=1.0, C% identical）。IRT fit diagnostics 在 worst 档下 仍然差（CFI=0.71,\n520\t    TLI=0.68, 远低于 0.90 threshold），因为 fit 问题不是 architecture heterogeneity 而是 57-subject\n521\t    multidimensionality。 这个实验在 worst 档下的结论是：architecture 不是 confounder（positive），\n522\t    但 IRT misfit 是 fundamental（negative）。Reviewer：''you''ve shown architecture isn''t\n523\t    the problem, but the IRT fit is still terrible — what IS the problem?'' Answer：multidimensionality。但\n524\t    MH 不依赖 IRT fit——这个 distinction 需要 in paper 但 reviewer 可能不接受。\n525\t\n526\t    '\n527\t  tables:\n528\t  - name: 'Table: IRT Fit Diagnostics'\n529\t    rows:\n530\t    - population: full (N=5227)\n531\t      rmsea: 0.049\n532\t      cfi: 0.71\n533\t      tli: 0.68\n534\t    - population: decoder-only (N=5226)\n535\t      rmsea: 0.048\n536\t      cfi: 0.71\n537\t      tli: 0.68\n538\t  figures_description: []\n539\t  analysis: 'Architecture stratification 在 worst 档下是 trivial experiment（99.98% homogeneous）。\n540\t    Positive finding（architecture not confounding）但不增加 persuasive value 因为 reviewer\n541\t    已经知道 METABENCH is decoder-only dominant。IRT fit diagnostics 反而打开 ''misspecification''\n542\t    attack surface。建议：report in one sentence + footnote，不做 major experiment。IRT fit\n543\t    numbers 放 appendix 如果 reviewer 问起。\n544\t\n545\t    '\n546\t- name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n547\t  plan_id: plan_011\n548\t  description: 'Known contamination injection into real METABENCH response matrix\n549\t    + DIF detection power。\n550\t\n551\t    '\n552\t  expected_results:\n553\t    temporal_external_tpr_p0: 0.326\n554\t    temporal_external_tpr_p03: 0.42\n555\t    temporal_external_tpr_p05: 0.58\n556\t    temporal_external_tpr_p07: 0.81\n557\t    temporal_external_tpr_p10: 0.95\n558\t    temporal_external_fpr: 0.318\n559\t    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05: 0.254\n560\t    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.624\n561\t    cross_subject_delta_fpr_p05: 0.012\n562\t    cross_subject_delta_fpr_p10: 0.018\n563\t    within_subject_fpr_inflation_p10: 0.196\n564\t    matching_variable_contamination: true\n565\t    n_clean_items: 500\n566\t    n_injected_items: 150\n567\t  result_rationale: 'Worst 档下 semi-synthetic 的核心退化在两处：(1) ΔTPR at p=0.5 从 registry\n568\t    的 0.508 降至 0.254——因为 permutation null 的存在意味着 baseline FPR 已经 high（0.318）， injection\n569\t    需要在 already-noisy background 上增加 signal。实际上 0.254 仍然 >0 证明 DIF 能检测 injected contamination，但\n570\t    reviewer 认为 power 不足以 claim ''practical detection capability''。(2) Cross-subject\n571\t    matching 的 ΔFPR 不再是 0.000 而是 0.012-0.018——permutation 分析揭示 cross-subject total\n572\t    score 与 temporal cohort membership 有 residual correlation through latent dimensions\n573\t    that cross-subject matching 未完全消除。0.012 仍然很低但不再是 ''provable FPR control'' 的 zero。这对\n574\t    Claim 3 的 framing 有 material impact：从 ''ΔFPR=0.000'' 改为 ''ΔFPR<0.02, near-zero\n575\t    FPR inflation''。Within-subject matching 的 FPR inflation 确认（0.196），strengthening\n576\t    the cross-subject recommendation。\n577\t\n578\t    '\n579\t  tables:\n580\t  - name: 'Table: Semi-Synthetic Detection Power (Worst Tier)'\n581\t    rows:\n582\t    - injection_p: 0.0\n583\t      tpr: 0.326\n584\t      fpr: 0.318\n585\t      delta_tpr: 0.0\n586\t    - injection_p: 0.3\n587\t      tpr: 0.42\n588\t      fpr: 0.319\n589\t      delta_tpr: 0.094\n590\t    - injection_p: 0.5\n591\t      tpr: 0.58\n592\t      fpr: 0.33\n593\t      delta_tpr: 0.254\n594\t    - injection_p: 0.7\n595\t      tpr: 0.81\n596\t      fpr: 0.331\n597\t      delta_tpr: 0.484\n598\t    - injection_p: 1.0\n599\t      tpr: 0.95\n600\t      fpr: 0.336\n601\t      delta_tpr: 0.624\n602\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Subject vs Within-Subject Matching FPR'\n603\t    rows:\n604\t    - matching: cross-subject\n605\t      delta_fpr_p05: 0.012\n606\t      delta_fpr_p10: 0.018\n607\t    - matching: within-subject\n608\t      delta_fpr_p05: 0.098\n609\t      delta_fpr_p10: 0.196\n610\t  figures_description:\n611\t  - 'Fig: ΔTPR dose-response curve at p=0.3 to 1.0 — monotone increasing but shifted\n612\t    down from registry values'\n613\t  - 'Fig: ΔFPR comparison: cross-subject (near-zero but nonzero) vs within-subject\n614\t    (substantial inflation)'\n615\t  analysis: 'Semi-synthetic 在 worst 档下仍然是 paper 最强的 methodological contribution，但需要\n616\t    recalibrate claims。ΔFPR=0.012 而非 0.000 意味着 ''provable FPR control'' 改为 ''near-zero\n617\t    FPR inflation (<2%)''——仍然是 strong practical recommendation 但 theoretical cleanness\n618\t    下降。ΔTPR=0.254 at p=0.5 仍然 statistically significant 但 reviewer 会 argue ''detection\n619\t    power 太低 for practical use below p=0.7''。 Key defense：semi-synthetic framework\n620\t    的 value 在于 methodology（reusable for any detector），不在于 specific power numbers。Cross-subject\n621\t    matching insight 独立于 DIF magnitude，是 genuine contribution。\n622\t\n623\t    '\n624\t- name: multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\n625\t  plan_id: plan_028\n626\t  description: '6 benchmarks（MMLU, WinoGrande, TruthfulQA, ARC, GSM8K, HellaSwag）temporal\n627\t    DIF atlas。\n628\t\n629\t    '\n630\t  expected_results:\n631\t    mmlu_c_pct: 31.3\n632\t    mmlu_permutation_null: 14.2\n633\t    mmlu_calibrated: 17.1\n634\t    winogrande_c_pct: 30.3\n635\t    winogrande_permutation_null: 16.8\n636\t    winogrande_calibrated: 13.5\n637\t    truthfulqa_c_pct: 29.7\n638\t    truthfulqa_permutation_null: 15.1\n639\t    truthfulqa_calibrated: 14.6\n640\t    arc_c_pct: 26.9\n641\t    arc_permutation_null: 12.3\n642\t    arc_calibrated: 14.6\n643\t    gsm8k_c_pct: 18.9\n644\t    gsm8k_permutation_null: 9.2\n645\t    gsm8k_calibrated: 9.7\n646\t    hellaswag_c_pct: 17.9\n647\t    hellaswag_permutation_null: 10.6\n648\t    hellaswag_calibrated: 7.3\n649\t    cross_benchmark_raw_range: 17.9–31.3%\n650\t    cross_benchmark_calibrated_range: 7.3–17.1%\n651\t    all_random_controls_below_1pct: true\n652\t    spearman_raw_vs_calibrated: 0.886\n653\t    n_items_correlation_with_c_pct: 0.72\n654\t  result_rationale: 'Permutation calibration 后的 cross-benchmark range 从 17.9–31.3%\n655\t    缩至 7.3–17.1%。 关键问题：HellaSwag calibrated=7.3% 和 GSM8K calibrated=9.7% 接近 ''trivial''\n656\t    水平， reviewer 会质疑这些 benchmark 上的 instability 是否 meaningful。MMLU 仍最高 （17.1%）但不再\n657\t    dramatic。Reviewer concern：n_items 与 C% 的 correlation=0.72 暗示 larger benchmarks\n658\t    产生 more DIF 可能是 statistical artifact（more items = more chances for stochastic\n659\t    DIF flags）。虽然 permutation null 应该 calibrate 这个 away，但 HellaSwag（10042 items）的\n660\t    null=10.6% 远高于 ARC（1172 items, null=12.3%） ——relationship 不是 monotone，但 reviewer\n661\t    仍然质疑。WinoGrande 和 TruthfulQA 的 calibrated C% 居中（13.5-14.6%），ARC 也类似（14.6%）。All\n662\t    random controls <1% 证明 temporal structure 是真实的——但 ''temporal structure ≠ item\n663\t    instability'' 在 worst 档下是 reviewer 的核心攻击。\n664\t\n665\t    '\n666\t  tables:\n667\t  - name: 'Table: Multi-Benchmark Temporal DIF Atlas (Raw vs Calibrated)'\n668\t    rows:\n669\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n670\t      n_items: 12508\n671\t      raw_c_pct: 31.3\n672\t      permutation_null: 14.2\n673\t      calibrated_c_pct: 17.1\n674\t      random_control: 0.18\n675\t    - benchmark: WinoGrande\n676\t      n_items: 1267\n677\t      raw_c_pct: 30.3\n678\t      permutation_null: 16.8\n679\t      calibrated_c_pct: 13.5\n680\t      random_control: 0.32\n681\t    - benchmark: TruthfulQA\n682\t      n_items: 817\n683\t      raw_c_pct: 29.7\n684\t      permutation_null: 15.1\n685\t      calibrated_c_pct: 14.6\n686\t      random_control: 0.37\n687\t    - benchmark: ARC\n688\t      n_items: 1172\n689\t      raw_c_pct: 26.9\n690\t      permutation_null: 12.3\n691\t      calibrated_c_pct: 14.6\n692\t      random_control: 0.6\n693\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n694\t      n_items: 1319\n695\t      raw_c_pct: 18.9\n696\t      permutation_null: 9.2\n697\t      calibrated_c_pct: 9.7\n698\t      random_control: 0.3\n699\t    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n700\t      n_items: 10042\n701\t      raw_c_pct: 17.9\n702\t      permutation_null: 10.6\n703\t      calibrated_c_pct: 7.3\n704\t      random_control: 0.28\n705\t  figures_description:\n706\t  - 'Fig: Bar chart of raw C% vs calibrated C% across 6 benchmarks, with permutation\n707\t    null as shaded band — visual impact of calibration is dramatic'\n708\t  - 'Fig: Calibrated C% vs benchmark n_items scatter — testing the ''more items =\n709\t    more DIF'' artifact hypothesis'\n710\t  analysis: 'Multi-benchmark atlas 在 worst 档下的 reframe value 很高：permutation calibration\n711\t    across 6 benchmarks 是 genuine methodological contribution（''establishing calibration\n712\t    requirements for future LLM DIF studies''）。Calibrated range 7.3–17.1% 仍然 2–3×\n713\t    above random controls，supporting ''genuine instability exists''。但 headline impact\n714\t    大幅下降——''7% of HellaSwag items show genuine temporal instability'' 不够 exciting\n715\t    for EMNLP long paper opening。Defense：atlas 作为 empirical resource 而非 single-number\n716\t    claim。Cross-benchmark variation itself 是 finding： ''benchmarks differ 2.3× in\n717\t    genuine instability rate, suggesting domain-specific temporal dynamics'' 是 legitimate\n718\t    contribution。\n719\t\n720\t    '\n721\t- name: permutation_null_c_rate\n722\t  plan_id: plan_029\n723\t  description: '1000× permutation test：随机重分配 temporal labels，建立 C% null distribution。\n724\t\n725\t    '\n726\t  expected_results:\n727\t    n_permutations: 1000\n728\t    null_c_pct_mean: 12.4\n729\t    null_c_pct_sd: 1.8\n730\t    null_c_pct_95ci:\n731\t    - 9.1\n732\t    - 16.2\n733\t    null_c_pct_p025: 9.3\n734\t    null_c_pct_p975: 16.1\n735\t    observed_c_pct: 31.3\n736\t    z_score_vs_null: 10.5\n737\t    empirical_p_value: 0.0\n738\t    genuine_excess_c_pct: 18.9\n739\t    pct_inflation_explained: 39.6\n740\t    ability_gap_in_permuted: mean d=0.001, sd=0.052\n741\t    temporal_structure_components:\n742\t      release_date_clustering: contributes ~7pp to null\n743\t      training_data_overlap: contributes ~3pp to null\n744\t      residual_cohort_structure: contributes ~2.4pp to null\n745\t  result_rationale: 'Permutation null C%=12.4%（CI 9.1–16.2%）揭示 temporal cohort 赋值本身带入\n746\t    substantial structure：即使在 random relabeling 下，2023 和 2024 cohort 的 model composition\n747\t    差异（不同 family 分布、不同 training data vintage）仍然 产生 ~12% DIF。这不是 ability confound（permuted\n748\t    d≈0.001）而是 temporal structure confound：模型的 release date、training data composition、architecture\n749\t    generations 在 temporal cohort 间不均匀分布。31.3% - 12.4% = 18.9% genuine excess，但 reviewer\n750\t    会 argue (a) 18.9% 远不如 31.3% dramatic，(b) 12.4% null 本身说明 MH-DIF 对 temporal structure\n751\t    过度敏感，(c) ''genuine excess'' 的定义依赖于 ''permutation null is the correct null''——如果\n752\t    temporal structure IS the confound of interest（not something to subtract），那么应该\n753\t    subtract 更少。 z=10.5 证明 31.3% 显著高于 null（p<0.001），但 reviewer 的 concern 不是 significance\n754\t    而是 magnitude：''significant ≠ important.''\n755\t\n756\t    '\n757\t  tables:\n758\t  - name: 'Table: Permutation Null Distribution'\n759\t    rows:\n760\t    - statistic: observed_c_pct\n761\t      value: 31.3\n762\t    - statistic: null_mean\n763\t      value: 12.4\n764\t    - statistic: null_sd\n765\t      value: 1.8\n766\t    - statistic: null_95ci\n767\t      value: '[9.1, 16.2]'\n768\t    - statistic: z_score\n769\t      value: 10.5\n770\t    - statistic: genuine_excess\n771\t      value: 18.9\n772\t    - statistic: pct_explained_by_structure\n773\t      value: 39.6%\n774\t  figures_description:\n775\t  - 'Fig: Permutation null histogram (1000×) with observed C%=31.3% as vertical line\n776\t    — clearly right of distribution but distribution itself centered at ~12%'\n777\t  - 'Fig: Null distribution decomposition — stacked contributions from release clustering,\n778\t    training overlap, residual'\n779\t  analysis: 'Permutation null 是 worst 档的 pivotal experiment。C%=12.4% null 意味着 naive\n780\t    DIF inflation 约 40%。这 simultaneously (a) weakens the 31% headline 和 (b) creates\n781\t    a new contribution：''permutation calibration reveals substantial temporal structure\n782\t    inflation in LLM DIF studies — future work must calibrate.'' Paper 的 reframe 核心在这里：permutation\n783\t    null 从 threat 变成 finding。 ''Temporal cohort structure inflates naive DIF by ~12pp''\n784\t    是 a warning to the field，独立于 specific instability number。但要 execute 这个 reframe，paper\n785\t    需要 convincingly argue 为什么 12.4% null 本身 interesting 而非 damning。 Defense：''all\n786\t    prior benchmark evaluation studies using temporal splits face this inflation —\n787\t    we are the first to quantify and correct for it.''\n788\t\n789\t    '\n790\t- name: odds_ratio_regression_transparency\n791\t  plan_id: plan_030\n792\t  description: 'Odds ratio + multi-R² + deviance + item-level vs domain-level accuracy\n793\t    change models。\n794\t\n795\t    '\n796\t  expected_results:\n797\t    model1_domain_mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n798\t    model1_domain_nagelkerke_r2: 0.0012\n799\t    model1_domain_or_per_010: 1.55\n800\t    model1_ci:\n801\t    - 1.19\n802\t    - 2.03\n803\t    model2_item_props_mcfadden_r2: 0.0523\n804\t    model2_item_props_nagelkerke_r2: 0.089\n805\t    model3_item_delta_mcfadden_r2: 0.0018\n806\t    model3_item_delta_or_per_010: 1.12\n807\t    model3_ci:\n808\t    - 1.02\n809\t    - 1.23\n810\t    model4_full_mcfadden_r2: 0.0545\n811\t    model4_nagelkerke_r2: 0.0924\n812\t    simpsons_paradox: true\n813\t    lr_test_m1_vs_m2_chi2: 690.2\n814\t    lr_test_m3_vs_m4_chi2: 702.1\n815\t    item_acc_change_marginal_significant: true\n816\t    item_acc_change_conditional_ns: true\n817\t    discrimination_or: 1.58\n818\t    difficulty_or: 0.74\n819\t  result_rationale: 'Worst 档下 Model 3（item-level accuracy Δ）的 OR=1.12 per 0.10 change\n820\t    是 marginally significant（CI=[1.02, 1.23]），给 reviewer ''DIF=ability proxy'' 的 ammunition。虽然\n821\t    conditional on item properties（Model 4）后 item Δ 变 nonsignificant（Simpson''s paradox\n822\t    confirmed），reviewer 会 argue Simpson''s paradox 本身说明 ''item difficulty 和 discrimination\n823\t    是 mediators not confounders， so conditioning on them removes genuine ability signal,\n824\t    not spurious confound.'' Nagelkerke R²=0.092 in full model 意味着 item properties\n825\t    解释 ~9% variance—— 虽然低但 reviewer 认为 remaining 91% unexplained doesn''t mean ''genuine\n826\t    instability''， 可能是 measurement noise / unmeasured confounders。discrimination OR=1.58\n827\t    意味着 high-discrimination items 更可能被 flagged——reviewer 质疑 ''DIF preferentially flags\n828\t    the best items, which is problematic for diagnostic interpretation.''\n829\t\n830\t    '\n831\t  tables:\n832\t  - name: 'Table: Logistic Regression Model Comparison (Worst Tier)'\n833\t    rows:\n834\t    - model: 'M1: domain Δ'\n835\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n836\t      key_or: 1.55 [1.19, 2.03]\n837\t      interpretation: domain improvement weakly predicts DIF\n838\t    - model: 'M2: domain Δ + item props'\n839\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0523\n840\t      key_or: disc=1.58, diff=0.74\n841\t      interpretation: item properties dominate over domain Δ\n842\t    - model: 'M3: item Δ'\n843\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0018\n844\t      key_or: 1.12 [1.02, 1.23]\n845\t      interpretation: item-level change marginally significant\n846\t    - model: 'M4: item Δ + item props'\n847\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0545\n848\t      key_or: item Δ ns; disc=1.58\n849\t      interpretation: Simpson's paradox — item Δ absorbed by properties\n850\t  figures_description:\n851\t  - 'Fig: Simpson''s paradox visualization — marginal vs conditional relationship\n852\t    between item accuracy change and DIF flag'\n853\t  analysis: OR regression 在 worst 档下是 transparency contribution 但也是 attack surface。\n854\t    Reviewer 可以同时 argue (a) R²<0.10 意味着 model doesn't explain DIF，所以 DIF is noise\n855\t    和 (b) Simpson's paradox 意味着 you're conditioning away the real signal。 这两个 attacks\n856\t    互相矛盾但 reviewer 可以 deploy both。Defense：focus on discrimination OR=1.58 作为 positive\n857\t    finding——'DIF preferentially flags items whose discrimination changed across cohorts,\n858\t    exactly what a temporal instability detector should do.' Simpson's paradox 解读为：'domain\n859\t    improvement is fully mediated through item-level properties, confirming that DIF\n860\t    operates at item level not domain level.'\n861\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"59e9cceb-2107-44b0-875b-8adf30456f69","uuid":"33f7682f-092b-4624-b6a1-d913621e535f","timestamp":"2026-05-21T13:16:26.024Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T122440/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Permutation null 暴露 temporal cohort structure 对 MH-DIF 的系统性 inflation：1000×\n  permutation 产生 C%=8–18% 的 null baseline，将 31.3% headline 拉低至 15–23% genuine item-level\n  instability。Ability confound 比 plan_027 的 2.4pp 估计严重——NN matching 未覆盖的 latent dimensions（57-subject\n  multidimensionality） 留下 6–12pp residual。Reviewer 共识：(1) no methodological contribution（MH\n  1988 直接套用）， (2) 31% inflated 且 permutation-calibrated number 不够 dramatic，(3) diagnostic\n  lens 是 post-hoc reframing 缺乏 prospective validation。GSM8K negative correlation 被解读为\n  DIF=ability proxy。 HellaSwag/GSM8K 的低 C% 与 MMLU 的高 C% 差异被质疑为 method artifact（item\n  count / domain structure 驱动）。 Reframe 方向：permutation calibration methodology 本身升格为\n  contribution，semi-synthetic framework 作为 primary，empirical atlas 作为 resource，headline\n  从 ''31% instability'' 改为 ''permutation-calibrated 15–23% genuine instability + calibration\n  methodology for future DIF studies''。仍冲 EMNLP long paper 但需 camera-ready 前补 propensity-score\n  matching 或 MIMIC model。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: 'METABENCH MMLU 5,219×12,508 response matrix 上的 MH-DIF，temporal/ability/within-family\n    cohort 对比 + Li et al. proxy validation + domain-specificity。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    temporal_ets_c_pct: 31.3\n    temporal_fpr_li_clean: 0.321\n    temporal_enrichment: 0.96\n    ability_ets_c_pct: 2.9\n    ability_enrichment: 1.19\n    within_family_llama2v3_c_pct: 61.3\n    within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n    domain_spearman_rho: 0.36\n    domain_spearman_p: 0.006\n    sanity_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n    temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n    n_subjects_with_nonzero_c: 57\n    subject_c_range: 20.7–48.4%\n  result_rationale: 'Raw numbers 与 registry 一致（plan_001 已完成），但在 worst 档下这些数字被后续实验重新解读：\n    31.3% 中有 8–18pp 来自 temporal structure（plan_029 permutation null），domain ρ=0.36（略高于\n    registry 的 0.307）意味着 domain-level ability improvement 的解释力比预期更强。 Llama-2v3 C%=61.3%\n    被 reviewer 用作 ''DIF captures ability gap'' 的直接证据——d=-0.99 的 cohort 产生 61.3% C%，d=-0.17\n    产生 31.3%，线性外推 d=0 时 C%≈25%，与 permutation null 上界吻合。enrichment≈1.0 仍然成立但对 reviewer\n    来说是 ''DIF 与 contamination 无关'' 的证据 而非 ''web labels 不适用'' 的证据——framing battle 在\n    worst 档下输给 reviewer。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary by Cohort Definition'\n    rows:\n    - cohort: temporal_2023v2024\n      n_ref: 1080\n      n_foc: 807\n      c_pct: 31.3\n      enrichment: 0.96\n      permutation_null_c_pct: 12.4 (worst-tier midpoint)\n      genuine_c_pct: ~18.9\n    - cohort: ability_quintile\n      n_ref: 1044\n      n_foc: 1044\n      c_pct: 2.9\n      enrichment: 1.19\n      permutation_null_c_pct: 0.21\n      genuine_c_pct: ~2.7\n    - cohort: within_family_llama2v3\n      n_ref: 161\n      n_foc: 308\n      c_pct: 61.3\n      enrichment: null\n      permutation_null_c_pct: '38.2'\n      genuine_c_pct: ~23.1\n  - name: 'Table 2: Domain-Specificity Top/Bottom 5 Subjects'\n    note: C% range 20.7–48.4%, ρ=0.36 with domain accuracy Δ\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1: C% histogram across 57 MMLU subjects, colored by domain accuracy Δ quartile\n    — worst 档下 top-quartile accuracy-Δ subjects 明显偏高 C%，ρ=0.36 可视化为斜向聚集'\n  analysis: 'plan_001 的 raw output 在 worst 档下不变，但 interpretive frame 被 plan_029 的\n    permutation null 彻底重写。31.3% 不再是 headline——permutation-calibrated 的 ~19% 才是。domain\n    ρ=0.36 虽然 item-level R²仍低（0.0007），但 reviewer 会 argue ecological correlation 足以\n    cast doubt。within-family Llama-2v3 的 61.3% 成为 ability confound 的 poster child。\n\n    '\n- name: rl_robustness_validation\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '验证 DIF 对 reasoning-RL 模型的鲁棒性：SFT baseline + alignment-RL (N=477) +\n    10-15 reasoning-RL models mixed into focal cohort。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sft_baseline_c_pct: 30.8\n    alignment_rl_cohort_c_pct: 31.1\n    reasoning_rl_mixed_c_pct: 30.5\n    dif_retention_jaccard_sft_vs_rl_mixed: 0.82\n    constat_auroc_on_rl_models: 0.58\n    mink_auroc_on_rl_models: 0.54\n    delong_p_dif_vs_constat: 0.34\n    tost_equivalence_p: 0.18\n    bootstrap_ci_dif_retention:\n    - 0.74\n    - 0.89\n    n_reasoning_rl_models: 13\n    n_total_focal_with_rl: 820\n  result_rationale: 'N=13 reasoning-RL 模型混入 N=807 focal cohort 后 total N=820，DIF 作为\n    group-level 方法对 13 个模型的加入不敏感（C% 从 31.3 微降至 30.5）。但这恰恰是问题：reviewer 指出 13/820=1.6%\n    的混入比例根本无法测试 robustness——即使 RL 模型完全破坏 DIF 信号， 1.6% 的权重也会被 group statistic 淹没。TOST\n    equivalence test p=0.18 不显著， 无法声称等价。DeLong test p=0.34 也不显著，但这是因为 power 不足而非真正等价。\n    ConStat/MinK 在 RL 模型上的 AUROC 降至 0.54-0.58（接近随机），但 N=13 的 CI 极宽， 任何比较都 underpowered。整个实验在\n    worst 档下被 reviewer 一致判定为 underpowered 且设计上无法回答其声称要回答的问题。移入 appendix 作为 preliminary\n    evidence。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: DIF Retention Under Cohort Composition Variation'\n    rows:\n    - condition: SFT-only focal\n      n_focal: 412\n      c_pct: 30.8\n      jaccard_vs_baseline: 0.87\n    - condition: Alignment-RL focal\n      n_focal: 477\n      c_pct: 31.1\n      jaccard_vs_baseline: 0.89\n    - condition: Reasoning-RL mixed\n      n_focal: 820\n      c_pct: 30.5\n      jaccard_vs_baseline: 0.82\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: AUROC comparison (DIF group-level vs ConStat/MinK per-model) on 13 RL models\n    — wide bootstrap CIs overlapping random baseline'\n  analysis: 'Worst 档下这个实验是 paper 的 liability 而非 asset。N=13 的 reasoning-RL sample 使任何统计声明都不可信。Reviewer\n    会指出：(a) 1.6% 混入比例是 trivial perturbation， (b) 缺乏 GRPO/PPO 模型的 MMLU response data\n    是 data limitation 而非 DIF limitation， (c) ''DIF is group-level so it doesn''t need\n    N≥80 RL'' 的 argument 回避了真正的问题。 建议：从 main body 移除，appendix 中报告为 ''preliminary with\n    acknowledged power limitation''。\n\n    '\n- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003a\n  description: 'ConStat-style perturbation测试：200+ MMLU items 的 LLM paraphrase + FDR-controlled\n    detection。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_paraphrased: 240\n    constat_detection_rate_non_rl: 0.23\n    constat_detection_rate_rl: 0.07\n    constat_fdr_controlled_fpr: 0.08\n    constat_dif_overlap_jaccard: 0.11\n    paraphrase_semantic_similarity: 0.91\n    gpu_hours_used: 72\n    n_models_tested: 50\n  result_rationale: 'ConStat 在 non-RL 模型上检测率 23%（中等），但在 RL 模型上暴跌至 7%——符合理论预期 但 N=240\n    items × 50 models 的规模使 CI 宽。与 DIF flags 的 Jaccard=0.11 极低， 意味着两种方法检测不同维度的 instability。在\n    worst 档下，reviewer 将此解读为 ''两种方法都不可靠'' 而非 ''互补覆盖''。paraphrase quality（similarity=0.91）被质疑\n    为不够 semantically equivalent——任何 detection 可能是 paraphrase artifact。 80 GPU hours\n    的投入产出比在 worst 档下被认为不值得放入 main body。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: ConStat detection rate vs DIF C-flag rate per subject, showing near-zero\n    correlation'\n  analysis: 'ConStat 独立结果在 worst 档下价值有限：detection rate 低且与 DIF 正交。 如果 reviewer 已经质疑\n    DIF 的 31% 是 inflated，ConStat 的 23% 也面临同样的 calibration 问题（没有 permutation null）。实验本身\n    clean 但不 strengthen paper。 建议：appendix baseline comparison，不作为 contribution。\n\n    '\n- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003b\n  description: 'DVD generation variance：10-15 open-weight 模型 × 50 responses/item ×\n    temperature sampling。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models: 12\n    n_items: 500\n    responses_per_item: 50\n    dvd_bimodal_detection_rate: 0.14\n    dvd_verbatim_detection_power: 0.09\n    dvd_variant_detection_power: 0.31\n    dvd_fpr: 0.12\n    gpu_hours_used: 65\n    dvd_dif_overlap_jaccard: 0.06\n  result_rationale: 'DVD 设计用于 variant contamination（模型见过 paraphrase 而非原题），对 verbatim\n    contamination 的检测力极低（0.09）。Bimodal distribution 在 temperature=0.7-1.0 下确实出现但 only\n    14% 的 items——大部分 contaminated items 不产生 bimodal variance 因为 LLM 在 high temperature\n    下的 stochasticity 掩盖了 memorization signal。 与 DIF 的 Jaccard=0.06 接近零：两种方法在 item-level\n    上几乎完全不重叠。 在 worst 档下，70 GPU hours 产出一个 near-null result，reviewer 认为 DVD evaluation\n    与 paper 的 temporal DIF 主线无关。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Bimodal score distribution example for 3 items — showing weak signal'\n  analysis: 'DVD 在 worst 档下是 sunk cost。Detection power 不足以作为 standalone baseline，\n    与 DIF 的互补性接近零。Reviewer 质疑为什么在 temporal DIF paper 中评估 generation variance method。建议：完全\n    drop，不进 appendix。\n\n    '\n- name: ensemble_fusion\n  plan_id: plan_003c\n  description: 'DIF + ConStat + DVD 三信号融合：majority voting + weighted fusion + cross-validation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ensemble_not_executed: true\n    reason: upstream signal quality insufficient for meaningful fusion\n    constat_weak: true\n    dvd_near_null: true\n    projected_2of3_tpr: 0.15\n    projected_2of3_fpr: 0.06\n    decision: killed — degrade to appendix note\n  result_rationale: 'ConStat detection rate=23% 和 DVD detection rate=14% 均低于 DIF 的\n    31.3%， 且三者 pairwise Jaccard 均<0.12。2-of-3 majority voting 的 TPR 暴跌至 ~15% 因为 agreement\n    极低——三种方法检测的是不同 item populations。Weighted fusion 可能略好但 cross-validation 在 N=240\n    items 上 overfit 风险高。在 worst 档下 ensemble 从未执行（per paper_framing: ''plan_003a/b/c\n    never executed''）， 这一决策被 worst 档的 upstream results 证明正确。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Ensemble 在 worst 档下正确地被 kill。upstream 信号质量不足、方法间 overlap 极低、 fusion 没有理论基础（不是\n    ''same signal different noise'' 而是 ''different signals''）。 Paper framing 中已标记为\n    ''Future work''。\n\n    '\n- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: 'GSM8K temporal DIF + GSM1K ground truth correlation + semi-synthetic\n    validation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    step1_gsm8k_temporal_c_pct: 18.9\n    step1_external_c_pct: 47.4\n    step1_sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n    step2_standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n    step2_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n    step2_standard_delta_tpr_p05: 0.32\n    step3_pearson_r: -0.478\n    step3_pearson_p: 0.005\n    step3_spearman_rho: -0.403\n    step3_n_models: 33\n    step3_ci_r:\n    - -0.71\n    - -0.16\n    step3_ci_rho:\n    - -0.66\n    - -0.03\n    permutation_null_gsm8k_c_pct: 9.2\n    genuine_c_pct_after_calibration: 9.7\n  result_rationale: 'GSM8K C%=18.9% 在 permutation calibration 后降至 ~9.7%（null=9.2%），远低于\n    MMLU calibrated ~19%。Reviewer 质疑：如果 permutation null 已经解释了一半的 GSM8K C%， genuine\n    instability 可能微不足道。Step 3 的 negative correlation (r=-0.478) 是 worst 档的核心问题——reviewer\n    解读为 ''DIF flags items where 2024 models improved most, and GSM1K gap shrinks for\n    these models because improvement is genuine (not contamination)''。即 DIF 不是在检测\n    instability 而是在检测 ability improvement。 ΔTPR at p=0.5 降至 0.32（worst 档范围内），semi-synthetic\n    仍然 work 但 power reduction 明显。N=33 使所有 correlation 的 CI 宽到包含 near-zero effect。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: GSM8K DIF Summary with Permutation Calibration'\n    rows:\n    - metric: raw_c_pct\n      value: 18.9\n    - metric: permutation_null_c_pct\n      value: 9.2\n    - metric: calibrated_genuine_c_pct\n      value: 9.7\n    - metric: gsm1k_correlation_r\n      value: -0.478\n    - metric: gsm1k_correlation_ci\n      value: '[-0.71, -0.16]'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scatter plot of DIF-C item proportion vs GSM1K gap (N=33 models) — negative\n    trend with wide CI band, annotated Deepseek-math-7b-rl as potential outlier'\n  analysis: 'GSM8K 在 worst 档下是 double-edged：semi-synthetic ΔTPR=0.818（p=1.0）证明 framework\n    portability，但 GSM1K negative correlation 被 reviewer 武器化为 ''DIF = ability proxy''\n    的证据。Permutation calibration 将 genuine C% 压至 ~10%， further weakening the instability\n    narrative。Paper 必须将 GSM1K correlation 从 ''contamination validation'' 完全 pivot\n    到 ''exploratory/anomalous finding requiring further investigation''。N=33 的 limitation\n    必须 prominent display。\n\n    '\n- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 'MMLU 57-subject bifactor IRT model + anchor item selection + fixed-parameter\n    calibration。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bifactor_convergence: false\n    attempted_subjects: 57\n    converged_subjects: 23\n    rmsea_converged: 0.089\n    cfi_converged: 0.74\n    tli_converged: 0.71\n    anchor_items_selected: 0\n    equating_completed: false\n    killed: true\n    kill_reason: bifactor non-convergence on 34/57 subjects; converged subjects show\n      poor fit\n  result_rationale: '57-subject MMLU 的 bifactor model 在 worst 档下无法收敛——items per subject\n    从 18（formal_logic）到 1534（miscellaneous），subject-specific factors 的 sample size\n    极不均衡。即使 converged subjects（23/57）的 fit 也差（RMSEA=0.089, CFI=0.74）， 因为 MMLU items\n    不满足 unidimensional within-subject assumption（moral_scenarios Q3=34.2% above 0.20）。没有\n    reliable bifactor model 就没有 anchor items， equating pipeline 无法启动。这与 registry 中\n    plan_015 被 killed 一致。 在 worst 档下，这不仅是 technical failure 而是 structural impossibility——\n    MMLU 的 multidimensionality 从根本上不适合 bifactor parameterization。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Bifactor failure 在 worst 档下被 reviewer 用作两面攻击：(1) ''if bifactor fails,\n    your MH-DIF conditioning on total score is even more misspecified''，(2) ''you\n    acknowledge multidimensionality but use a unidimensional method''。Defense： MH\n    conditions on observed total score（nonparametric），不依赖 IRT model fit。 但 reviewer\n    不一定接受这个区分。建议：limitations 中 prominently acknowledge， frame as motivation for future\n    multidimensional DIF work。\n\n    '\n- name: item_generation_calibration\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: 'LLM-generated replacement items for DIF-flagged questions + student\n    simulation calibration。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_generated: 300\n    difficulty_correlation_prompt: 0.18\n    difficulty_correlation_simulation: 0.62\n    difficulty_correlation_empirical: 0.48\n    subject_match_rate: 0.83\n    cognitive_level_match_rate: 0.61\n    holdout_model_panel_rho: 0.72\n    gpu_hours_used: 180\n    item_quality_pass_rate: 0.41\n  result_rationale: 'Item generation 在 worst 档下的核心问题是 calibration accuracy：prompt-based\n    difficulty targeting 仍然差（ρ=0.18），student simulation 改善至 0.62 但不及 arXiv 报告的 0.75-0.82\n    因为 MMLU 的 57-subject diversity 使 simulation 泛化差。 Empirical calibration（在 holdout\n    models 上测试）降至 0.48，因为 LLM-generated items 的 discrimination 系统性偏低（生成的 items 倾向于\n    either too easy or 随机 difficulty）。41% 的 quality pass rate 意味着 300 items 中只有 ~123\n    可用。 Cognitive level matching 只有 61% 因为 MMLU 本身没有 explicit cognitive level labels。在\n    worst 档下，reviewer 认为 item generation 是 tangential to paper''s contribution 且 execution\n    quality 不足以支撑任何 claim。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Difficulty calibration scatter — generated vs empirical, showing systematic\n    underestimation of hard items'\n  analysis: 'Item generation 在 worst 档下应完全 drop from paper。ρ=0.48 的 empirical calibration\n    + 41% pass rate 不构成 contribution。且 paper 已 pivot away from ''regeneration'' toward\n    ''diagnostic lens''，generation 不 serve the narrative。 180 GPU hours sunk cost。\n\n    '\n- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: 'Sinharay et al. (2006) cumulative Bayesian DIF priors across 4 simulated\n    administrations。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    single_admin_power_d10: 0.38\n    cumulative_2_admin_power_d10: 0.52\n    cumulative_3_admin_power_d10: 0.61\n    cumulative_4_admin_power_d10: 0.67\n    target_power_0_70_reached: false\n    single_admin_power_d14: 0.59\n    cumulative_3_admin_power_d14: 0.74\n    fpr_cumulative: 0.055\n    prior_specification_sensitivity: moderate — informative vs diffuse prior changes\n      power by ±0.08\n  result_rationale: 'Cumulative power 在 worst 档下不达标（0.67 < 0.70 at δ=1.0 after 4 admins），\n    因为 simulation 使用 realistic parameters（not optimistic）：inter-administration correlation\n    of DIF effects < 1.0（items 的 DIF 在不同时间点不完全一致）， prior-posterior updating efficiency\n    受 small N per administration 限制。 Prior specification sensitivity ±0.08 意味着结果对分析选择敏感。\n    Reviewer 认为：(a) simulation-only 没有 empirical grounding，(b) 4 administrations 是假设性的（METABENCH\n    只有 1 snapshot），(c) power improvement 从 0.38 到 0.67 modest且 costly（需要 4× data）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cumulative Power by Administration Count'\n    rows:\n    - admins: 1\n      power_d10: 0.38\n      power_d14: 0.59\n    - admins: 2\n      power_d10: 0.52\n      power_d14: 0.68\n    - admins: 3\n      power_d10: 0.61\n      power_d14: 0.74\n    - admins: 4\n      power_d10: 0.67\n      power_d14: 0.78\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Power accumulation curves at δ=1.0 and δ=1.4, with 70% threshold line —\n    δ=1.0 never crosses'\n  analysis: 'Simulation-only experiment 在 worst 档下是 appendix material。不达 0.70 target\n    at δ=1.0 是 honest result 但 weakens the ''DIF is practical'' narrative。 Reviewer：''if\n    you need 4 benchmark snapshots to detect medium effects, the method is impractical\n    for real-time monitoring.'' 建议：brief mention in future work， 不进 main body。\n\n    '\n- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 'Progressive item replacement (5%-50%) 下 validity degradation 的理论 +\n    实证分析。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    rho_5pct_replacement: 0.998\n    rho_10pct_replacement: 0.995\n    rho_20pct_replacement: 0.987\n    rho_50pct_replacement: 0.962\n    reliability_alpha_full: 0.94\n    reliability_alpha_50pct_replaced: 0.88\n    construct_coverage_50pct: 0.79\n    degradation_rate: non-linear — accelerates after 30%\n    theoretical_bound_violation_at: 42% replacement\n  result_rationale: 'Graceful degradation 在 worst 档下呈现 non-linear cliff：前 20% replacement\n    几乎无影响（ρ=0.987），但 30%+ 后加速恶化，50% 时 reliability 降至 0.88（acceptable 但 approaching\n    concern），construct coverage 降至 0.79。问题是：31% 的 DIF items 恰好落在 cliff 的起始区域——如果要\n    replace 所有 flagged items，degradation 开始 加速。Reviewer 会 point out：''your own analysis\n    shows that replacing 31% of items causes non-trivial degradation, undermining\n    the regeneration rationale.'' 但 paper 已 pivot away from regeneration，所以这个 concern\n    被 defused。 不过 worst 档下 reviewer 仍然 raise it as internal inconsistency。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Validity Metrics Under Progressive Replacement'\n    rows:\n    - pct_replaced: 5\n      rho: 0.998\n      alpha: 0.935\n      coverage: 0.97\n    - pct_replaced: 10\n      rho: 0.995\n      alpha: 0.928\n      coverage: 0.95\n    - pct_replaced: 20\n      rho: 0.987\n      alpha: 0.912\n      coverage: 0.91\n    - pct_replaced: 50\n      rho: 0.962\n      alpha: 0.88\n      coverage: 0.79\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Degradation curves for ρ, α, coverage — showing non-linear cliff around\n    30%'\n  analysis: 'Graceful degradation 在 worst 档下是 supplementary material。Non-linear cliff\n    at ~30% 是 interesting finding 但与 reframed narrative（diagnostic lens, not replacement\n    protocol）的关系 tangential。建议：appendix 中报告，main body 中 一句话引用 ''replacement beyond\n    30% shows accelerating degradation''。\n\n    '\n- name: item_focused_trees\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: 'Tutz & Berger (2016) IFT：release date 作为 continuous covariate 的 DIF\n    检测。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ift_c_pct_continuous: 27.4\n    ift_mh_concordance: 0.78\n    ift_detects_gradual_drift: true\n    n_items_gradual_not_abrupt: 1840\n    pct_gradual: 47.0\n    ift_vs_mh_power_ratio: 0.92\n    computation_time_hours: 8.2\n  result_rationale: 'IFT 在 worst 档下揭示一个 uncomfortable truth：47% 的 DIF items 展示的是 gradual\n    temporal drift 而非 abrupt cohort shift。这意味着 MH 的 binary temporal split (2023 vs\n    2024) 人为地将 continuous process discretize——reviewer 质疑 为什么不直接用 IFT。IFT concordance\n    with MH = 0.78（不够高），IFT C%=27.4% vs MH 31.3%——差异来自 IFT 对 gradual drift 的不同 classification。\n    IFT 的 power ratio=0.92（vs MH）表明 continuous approach 没有 power advantage， 反而 computational\n    cost 高 8×。但 reviewer 的 concern 不是 power 而是 validity： ''if drift is gradual, your\n    cohort-based framework is misspecified.''\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: IFT vs MH Detection Comparison'\n    rows:\n    - method: MH categorical\n      c_pct: 31.3\n      computation_hours: 1.0\n      gradual_detection: 'no'\n    - method: IFT continuous\n      c_pct: 27.4\n      computation_hours: 8.2\n      gradual_detection: yes (47% gradual)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Example items showing gradual vs abrupt DIF trajectories — IFT captures\n    both, MH only captures abrupt'\n  analysis: 'IFT 在 worst 档下是 challenging but informative robustness check。47% gradual\n    drift 的 finding 如果放在 main body 会 undermine categorical DIF framework。 但如果放在 appendix\n    作为 ''MH is conservative approximation of continuous drift'' 的 evidence，可以 strengthen\n    而非 weaken the paper。关键 framing：''MH detects the 53% of items with abrupt changes\n    + partially detects the 47% with gradual drift — our 31% is a lower bound on items\n    with ANY temporal instability.'' 这需要 careful writing 但在 worst 档下是 feasible defense。\n\n    '\n- name: architecture_stratified_dif\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: 'Decoder-only subpopulation DIF + IRT fit diagnostics。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_decoder_only: 5226\n    n_non_decoder: 1\n    pct_decoder_only: 99.98\n    decoder_only_c_pct: 31.3\n    full_population_c_pct: 31.3\n    jaccard_decoder_vs_full: 1.0\n    rmsea_decoder_only: 0.048\n    cfi_decoder_only: 0.71\n    tli_decoder_only: 0.68\n    srmr_decoder_only: 0.052\n    irt_fit_improved: false\n  result_rationale: 'METABENCH MMLU 是 99.98% decoder-only（5226/5227），移除 1 个 non-decoder\n    模型 改变 nothing（Jaccard=1.0, C% identical）。IRT fit diagnostics 在 worst 档下 仍然差（CFI=0.71,\n    TLI=0.68, 远低于 0.90 threshold），因为 fit 问题不是 architecture heterogeneity 而是 57-subject\n    multidimensionality。 这个实验在 worst 档下的结论是：architecture 不是 confounder（positive），\n    但 IRT misfit 是 fundamental（negative）。Reviewer：''you''ve shown architecture isn''t\n    the problem, but the IRT fit is still terrible — what IS the problem?'' Answer：multidimensionality。但\n    MH 不依赖 IRT fit——这个 distinction 需要 in paper 但 reviewer 可能不接受。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: IRT Fit Diagnostics'\n    rows:\n    - population: full (N=5227)\n      rmsea: 0.049\n      cfi: 0.71\n      tli: 0.68\n    - population: decoder-only (N=5226)\n      rmsea: 0.048\n      cfi: 0.71\n      tli: 0.68\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Architecture stratification 在 worst 档下是 trivial experiment（99.98% homogeneous）。\n    Positive finding（architecture not confounding）但不增加 persuasive value 因为 reviewer\n    已经知道 METABENCH is decoder-only dominant。IRT fit diagnostics 反而打开 ''misspecification''\n    attack surface。建议：report in one sentence + footnote，不做 major experiment。IRT fit\n    numbers 放 appendix 如果 reviewer 问起。\n\n    '\n- name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 'Known contamination injection into real METABENCH response matrix\n    + DIF detection power。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    temporal_external_tpr_p0: 0.326\n    temporal_external_tpr_p03: 0.42\n    temporal_external_tpr_p05: 0.58\n    temporal_external_tpr_p07: 0.81\n    temporal_external_tpr_p10: 0.95\n    temporal_external_fpr: 0.318\n    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05: 0.254\n    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.624\n    cross_subject_delta_fpr_p05: 0.012\n    cross_subject_delta_fpr_p10: 0.018\n    within_subject_fpr_inflation_p10: 0.196\n    matching_variable_contamination: true\n    n_clean_items: 500\n    n_injected_items: 150\n  result_rationale: 'Worst 档下 semi-synthetic 的核心退化在两处：(1) ΔTPR at p=0.5 从 registry\n    的 0.508 降至 0.254——因为 permutation null 的存在意味着 baseline FPR 已经 high（0.318）， injection\n    需要在 already-noisy background 上增加 signal。实际上 0.254 仍然 >0 证明 DIF 能检测 injected contamination，但\n    reviewer 认为 power 不足以 claim ''practical detection capability''。(2) Cross-subject\n    matching 的 ΔFPR 不再是 0.000 而是 0.012-0.018——permutation 分析揭示 cross-subject total\n    score 与 temporal cohort membership 有 residual correlation through latent dimensions\n    that cross-subject matching 未完全消除。0.012 仍然很低但不再是 ''provable FPR control'' 的 zero。这对\n    Claim 3 的 framing 有 material impact：从 ''ΔFPR=0.000'' 改为 ''ΔFPR<0.02, near-zero\n    FPR inflation''。Within-subject matching 的 FPR inflation 确认（0.196），strengthening\n    the cross-subject recommendation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Semi-Synthetic Detection Power (Worst Tier)'\n    rows:\n    - injection_p: 0.0\n      tpr: 0.326\n      fpr: 0.318\n      delta_tpr: 0.0\n    - injection_p: 0.3\n      tpr: 0.42\n      fpr: 0.319\n      delta_tpr: 0.094\n    - injection_p: 0.5\n      tpr: 0.58\n      fpr: 0.33\n      delta_tpr: 0.254\n    - injection_p: 0.7\n      tpr: 0.81\n      fpr: 0.331\n      delta_tpr: 0.484\n    - injection_p: 1.0\n      tpr: 0.95\n      fpr: 0.336\n      delta_tpr: 0.624\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Subject vs Within-Subject Matching FPR'\n    rows:\n    - matching: cross-subject\n      delta_fpr_p05: 0.012\n      delta_fpr_p10: 0.018\n    - matching: within-subject\n      delta_fpr_p05: 0.098\n      delta_fpr_p10: 0.196\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: ΔTPR dose-response curve at p=0.3 to 1.0 — monotone increasing but shifted\n    down from registry values'\n  - 'Fig: ΔFPR comparison: cross-subject (near-zero but nonzero) vs within-subject\n    (substantial inflation)'\n  analysis: 'Semi-synthetic 在 worst 档下仍然是 paper 最强的 methodological contribution，但需要\n    recalibrate claims。ΔFPR=0.012 而非 0.000 意味着 ''provable FPR control'' 改为 ''near-zero\n    FPR inflation (<2%)''——仍然是 strong practical recommendation 但 theoretical cleanness\n    下降。ΔTPR=0.254 at p=0.5 仍然 statistically significant 但 reviewer 会 argue ''detection\n    power 太低 for practical use below p=0.7''。 Key defense：semi-synthetic framework\n    的 value 在于 methodology（reusable for any detector），不在于 specific power numbers。Cross-subject\n    matching insight 独立于 DIF magnitude，是 genuine contribution。\n\n    '\n- name: multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\n  plan_id: plan_028\n  description: '6 benchmarks（MMLU, WinoGrande, TruthfulQA, ARC, GSM8K, HellaSwag）temporal\n    DIF atlas。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mmlu_c_pct: 31.3\n    mmlu_permutation_null: 14.2\n    mmlu_calibrated: 17.1\n    winogrande_c_pct: 30.3\n    winogrande_permutation_null: 16.8\n    winogrande_calibrated: 13.5\n    truthfulqa_c_pct: 29.7\n    truthfulqa_permutation_null: 15.1\n    truthfulqa_calibrated: 14.6\n    arc_c_pct: 26.9\n    arc_permutation_null: 12.3\n    arc_calibrated: 14.6\n    gsm8k_c_pct: 18.9\n    gsm8k_permutation_null: 9.2\n    gsm8k_calibrated: 9.7\n    hellaswag_c_pct: 17.9\n    hellaswag_permutation_null: 10.6\n    hellaswag_calibrated: 7.3\n    cross_benchmark_raw_range: 17.9–31.3%\n    cross_benchmark_calibrated_range: 7.3–17.1%\n    all_random_controls_below_1pct: true\n    spearman_raw_vs_calibrated: 0.886\n    n_items_correlation_with_c_pct: 0.72\n  result_rationale: 'Permutation calibration 后的 cross-benchmark range 从 17.9–31.3%\n    缩至 7.3–17.1%。 关键问题：HellaSwag calibrated=7.3% 和 GSM8K calibrated=9.7% 接近 ''trivial''\n    水平， reviewer 会质疑这些 benchmark 上的 instability 是否 meaningful。MMLU 仍最高 （17.1%）但不再\n    dramatic。Reviewer concern：n_items 与 C% 的 correlation=0.72 暗示 larger benchmarks\n    产生 more DIF 可能是 statistical artifact（more items = more chances for stochastic\n    DIF flags）。虽然 permutation null 应该 calibrate 这个 away，但 HellaSwag（10042 items）的\n    null=10.6% 远高于 ARC（1172 items, null=12.3%） ——relationship 不是 monotone，但 reviewer\n    仍然质疑。WinoGrande 和 TruthfulQA 的 calibrated C% 居中（13.5-14.6%），ARC 也类似（14.6%）。All\n    random controls <1% 证明 temporal structure 是真实的——但 ''temporal structure ≠ item\n    instability'' 在 worst 档下是 reviewer 的核心攻击。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Multi-Benchmark Temporal DIF Atlas (Raw vs Calibrated)'\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: MMLU\n      n_items: 12508\n      raw_c_pct: 31.3\n      permutation_null: 14.2\n      calibrated_c_pct: 17.1\n      random_control: 0.18\n    - benchmark: WinoGrande\n      n_items: 1267\n      raw_c_pct: 30.3\n      permutation_null: 16.8\n      calibrated_c_pct: 13.5\n      random_control: 0.32\n    - benchmark: TruthfulQA\n      n_items: 817\n      raw_c_pct: 29.7\n      permutation_null: 15.1\n      calibrated_c_pct: 14.6\n      random_control: 0.37\n    - benchmark: ARC\n      n_items: 1172\n      raw_c_pct: 26.9\n      permutation_null: 12.3\n      calibrated_c_pct: 14.6\n      random_control: 0.6\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      n_items: 1319\n      raw_c_pct: 18.9\n      permutation_null: 9.2\n      calibrated_c_pct: 9.7\n      random_control: 0.3\n    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n      n_items: 10042\n      raw_c_pct: 17.9\n      permutation_null: 10.6\n      calibrated_c_pct: 7.3\n      random_control: 0.28\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Bar chart of raw C% vs calibrated C% across 6 benchmarks, with permutation\n    null as shaded band — visual impact of calibration is dramatic'\n  - 'Fig: Calibrated C% vs benchmark n_items scatter — testing the ''more items =\n    more DIF'' artifact hypothesis'\n  analysis: 'Multi-benchmark atlas 在 worst 档下的 reframe value 很高：permutation calibration\n    across 6 benchmarks 是 genuine methodological contribution（''establishing calibration\n    requirements for future LLM DIF studies''）。Calibrated range 7.3–17.1% 仍然 2–3×\n    above random controls，supporting ''genuine instability exists''。但 headline impact\n    大幅下降——''7% of HellaSwag items show genuine temporal instability'' 不够 exciting\n    for EMNLP long paper opening。Defense：atlas 作为 empirical resource 而非 single-number\n    claim。Cross-benchmark variation itself 是 finding： ''benchmarks differ 2.3× in\n    genuine instability rate, suggesting domain-specific temporal dynamics'' 是 legitimate\n    contribution。\n\n    '\n- name: permutation_null_c_rate\n  plan_id: plan_029\n  description: '1000× permutation test：随机重分配 temporal labels，建立 C% null distribution。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_permutations: 1000\n    null_c_pct_mean: 12.4\n    null_c_pct_sd: 1.8\n    null_c_pct_95ci:\n    - 9.1\n    - 16.2\n    null_c_pct_p025: 9.3\n    null_c_pct_p975: 16.1\n    observed_c_pct: 31.3\n    z_score_vs_null: 10.5\n    empirical_p_value: 0.0\n    genuine_excess_c_pct: 18.9\n    pct_inflation_explained: 39.6\n    ability_gap_in_permuted: mean d=0.001, sd=0.052\n    temporal_structure_components:\n      release_date_clustering: contributes ~7pp to null\n      training_data_overlap: contributes ~3pp to null\n      residual_cohort_structure: contributes ~2.4pp to null\n  result_rationale: 'Permutation null C%=12.4%（CI 9.1–16.2%）揭示 temporal cohort 赋值本身带入\n    substantial structure：即使在 random relabeling 下，2023 和 2024 cohort 的 model composition\n    差异（不同 family 分布、不同 training data vintage）仍然 产生 ~12% DIF。这不是 ability confound（permuted\n    d≈0.001）而是 temporal structure confound：模型的 release date、training data composition、architecture\n    generations 在 temporal cohort 间不均匀分布。31.3% - 12.4% = 18.9% genuine excess，但 reviewer\n    会 argue (a) 18.9% 远不如 31.3% dramatic，(b) 12.4% null 本身说明 MH-DIF 对 temporal structure\n    过度敏感，(c) ''genuine excess'' 的定义依赖于 ''permutation null is the correct null''——如果\n    temporal structure IS the confound of interest（not something to subtract），那么应该\n    subtract 更少。 z=10.5 证明 31.3% 显著高于 null（p<0.001），但 reviewer 的 concern 不是 significance\n    而是 magnitude：''significant ≠ important.''\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Permutation Null Distribution'\n    rows:\n    - statistic: observed_c_pct\n      value: 31.3\n    - statistic: null_mean\n      value: 12.4\n    - statistic: null_sd\n      value: 1.8\n    - statistic: null_95ci\n      value: '[9.1, 16.2]'\n    - statistic: z_score\n      value: 10.5\n    - statistic: genuine_excess\n      value: 18.9\n    - statistic: pct_explained_by_structure\n      value: 39.6%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Permutation null histogram (1000×) with observed C%=31.3% as vertical line\n    — clearly right of distribution but distribution itself centered at ~12%'\n  - 'Fig: Null distribution decomposition — stacked contributions from release clustering,\n    training overlap, residual'\n  analysis: 'Permutation null 是 worst 档的 pivotal experiment。C%=12.4% null 意味着 naive\n    DIF inflation 约 40%。这 simultaneously (a) weakens the 31% headline 和 (b) creates\n    a new contribution：''permutation calibration reveals substantial temporal structure\n    inflation in LLM DIF studies — future work must calibrate.'' Paper 的 reframe 核心在这里：permutation\n    null 从 threat 变成 finding。 ''Temporal cohort structure inflates naive DIF by ~12pp''\n    是 a warning to the field，独立于 specific instability number。但要 execute 这个 reframe，paper\n    需要 convincingly argue 为什么 12.4% null 本身 interesting 而非 damning。 Defense：''all\n    prior benchmark evaluation studies using temporal splits face this inflation —\n    we are the first to quantify and correct for it.''\n\n    '\n- name: odds_ratio_regression_transparency\n  plan_id: plan_030\n  description: 'Odds ratio + multi-R² + deviance + item-level vs domain-level accuracy\n    change models。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model1_domain_mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n    model1_domain_nagelkerke_r2: 0.0012\n    model1_domain_or_per_010: 1.55\n    model1_ci:\n    - 1.19\n    - 2.03\n    model2_item_props_mcfadden_r2: 0.0523\n    model2_item_props_nagelkerke_r2: 0.089\n    model3_item_delta_mcfadden_r2: 0.0018\n    model3_item_delta_or_per_010: 1.12\n    model3_ci:\n    - 1.02\n    - 1.23\n    model4_full_mcfadden_r2: 0.0545\n    model4_nagelkerke_r2: 0.0924\n    simpsons_paradox: true\n    lr_test_m1_vs_m2_chi2: 690.2\n    lr_test_m3_vs_m4_chi2: 702.1\n    item_acc_change_marginal_significant: true\n    item_acc_change_conditional_ns: true\n    discrimination_or: 1.58\n    difficulty_or: 0.74\n  result_rationale: 'Worst 档下 Model 3（item-level accuracy Δ）的 OR=1.12 per 0.10 change\n    是 marginally significant（CI=[1.02, 1.23]），给 reviewer ''DIF=ability proxy'' 的 ammunition。虽然\n    conditional on item properties（Model 4）后 item Δ 变 nonsignificant（Simpson''s paradox\n    confirmed），reviewer 会 argue Simpson''s paradox 本身说明 ''item difficulty 和 discrimination\n    是 mediators not confounders， so conditioning on them removes genuine ability signal,\n    not spurious confound.'' Nagelkerke R²=0.092 in full model 意味着 item properties\n    解释 ~9% variance—— 虽然低但 reviewer 认为 remaining 91% unexplained doesn''t mean ''genuine\n    instability''， 可能是 measurement noise / unmeasured confounders。discrimination OR=1.58\n    意味着 high-discrimination items 更可能被 flagged——reviewer 质疑 ''DIF preferentially flags\n    the best items, which is problematic for diagnostic interpretation.''\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Logistic Regression Model Comparison (Worst Tier)'\n    rows:\n    - model: 'M1: domain Δ'\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n      key_or: 1.55 [1.19, 2.03]\n      interpretation: domain improvement weakly predicts DIF\n    - model: 'M2: domain Δ + item props'\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0523\n      key_or: disc=1.58, diff=0.74\n      interpretation: item properties dominate over domain Δ\n    - model: 'M3: item Δ'\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0018\n      key_or: 1.12 [1.02, 1.23]\n      interpretation: item-level change marginally significant\n    - model: 'M4: item Δ + item props'\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0545\n      key_or: item Δ ns; disc=1.58\n      interpretation: Simpson's paradox — item Δ absorbed by properties\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Simpson''s paradox visualization — marginal vs conditional relationship\n    between item accuracy change and DIF flag'\n  analysis: OR regression 在 worst 档下是 transparency contribution 但也是 attack surface。\n    Reviewer 可以同时 argue (a) R²<0.10 意味着 model doesn't explain DIF，所以 DIF is noise\n    和 (b) Simpson's paradox 意味着 you're conditioning away the real signal。 这两个 attacks\n    互相矛盾但 reviewer 可以 deploy both。Defense：focus on discrimination OR=1.58 作为 positive\n    finding——'DIF preferentially flags items whose discrimination changed across cohorts,\n    exactly what a temporal instability detector should do.' Simpson's paradox 解读为：'domain\n    improvement is fully mediated through item-level properties, confirming that DIF\n    operates at item level not domain level.'\n","numLines":861,"startLine":1,"totalLines":861}}}
